      "description": "<p>Total number of missing Britons between Tibet and Nepal at 48 as Beijing mobilises more than 2,100 rescue workers</p><p>Fifteen British nationals are reported to be missing in China as the search continues for survivors of the devastating flooding in Nepal and Tibet.</p><p>Nepali and Chinese authorities confirmed an updated death toll of at least 810 on Sunday. More than 3,000 people are believed missing after flash floods triggered by a massive glacier collapse in the Himalayas on Wednesday engulfed Gyirong port on the Nepal-China border.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/aug/30/britons-foreigners-missing-china-tibet-nepal-floods\">Continue reading...</a>",
